# Content-builder runtime

Student lessons are **static**. No required student login, API key, or remote computation.

- Authoring tools may use authenticated connections (Drive, Hugging Face). The exported page must not.
- Public embeds may need internet. Provide an **equivalent local task** (JSXGraph, image, or paper prompt) when the embed fails or is blocked.
- Exclude **Gizmos** from required activities (account/preview limits).
- Exclude the programmable **Desmos API** (needs a key). Public provider embed code, tested signed out, is allowed.
- Do not ship credentials in `build/` HTML.
